OL,3,AUK-Iranian dual national arrested over
OL,4,ARAF Fairford incident, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men in their twenties who were
OL,7,Farrested near the Gloucestershire
OL,8,Fairbase on Sunday remain on police
OL,9,Fbail. All five were UK nationals from
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FCounter-terror police are considering
OL,13,F"all possible angles - including
OL,14,Fforeign state involvement", the force's
OL,15,Fsenior national coordinator Vicki Evans
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
